WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.500
[Celia] You're a jerk, Thom.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[Thom] Look Celia, we have to follow our passions;

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.500
[Thom] you have your robotics, and I just want to be awesome in space.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.000
[Celia] Why don't you just admit that you're freaked out by my robot hand?

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.000
[Thom] I'm not freaked out by— it's...

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[Thom] Alright! Fine!

7
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
[Thom] I'm freaked out! I have nightmares that I'm being chased

8
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.000
[Thom] by these giant robotic claws of death...

9
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.000
[Celia] Whatever, Thom. We're done.
